        '6-8', $q$The Snow Shovel Crew$q$, $q$(1) Last winter, my friends and I started a group called the Snow Shovel Crew. (2) Our street has many older neighbors who find it hard to clear their own sidewalks. (3) Our first job came after a heavy storm dropped almost a foot of snow overnight in January. (4) The next morning, five of us grabbed shovels and knocked on doors. (5) We cleared six walkways before lunch, and Mr. Okafor brought us mugs of hot cocoa.

