  ('534b250f-4d32-5327-afd8-36e01de9c646', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Read: "____ The new paths connect the middle school to Lakeside Park. Riders no longer have to share the road with cars and buses. Since the paths opened, twice as many students ride bikes to school." Which topic sentence best begins this paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Twice as many students now ride their bikes to school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Riding a bike is good exercise for people of all ages.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"Many cars in Riverton are driven much too fast.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic-topic-sentence"},{"text":"The new bike paths in Riverton have made biking safer and more popular.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The new bike paths in Riverton have made biking safer and more popular.$q$, $q$Every detail is about the new paths making biking safer and drawing more riders, so this sentence covers them all. The sentence about twice as many students is only one detail and leaves out the safety idea.$q$, 'draft', null)
