  ('7640cccc-6a41-51eb-b1b0-996656363f99', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g6-paragraph-transitions'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Read: "A cactus stores water inside its thick stem to survive long dry spells. ____, some desert frogs store water inside their bodies and wait underground for rain." Which transition best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"However,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-similarity"},{"text":"As a result,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-cause"},{"text":"Likewise,","is_correct":true},{"text":"First,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"sequence-for-similarity"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Likewise,$q$, $q$Both the cactus and the frogs survive dry times by storing water, so "Likewise" shows the two are alike. "As a result" is wrong because the cactus storing water does not cause the frogs to do anything.$q$, 'draft', null)
